{"id":"input-ccb07bbfc412","steamAppId":"1433340","name":"Happy's Humble Burger Farm","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433340/library_600x900.jpg","imageStatus":"downloaded","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1433340/","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","Simulation"],"platforms":["windows"],"controllerSupport":"full","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":15.0,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"15 GB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","custom":{},"sourceProfile":{"inputRecordId":"input-ccb07bbfc412","canonicalId":"steam-app-1433340","suppliedName":"Happy's Humble Burger Farm","suppliedImageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433340/library_600x900.jpg","officialName":"Happy's Humble Burger Farm","aliases":[],"series":null,"franchise":null,"productType":"game","editionName":null,"originalReleaseYear":null,"identifiedVersionReleaseYear":2021,"developers":["Scythe Dev Team"],"publishers":["tinyBuild"],"platforms":["windows"],"genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","Simulation"],"shortDescription":"Congrats, you're hired! Serve customers and maintain the Happy's Humble Burger Farm restaurant alone on the overnight. But be careful; things fall apart if you mess up! After work, head home and keep your eyes open for a way to escape the Barnyard Buds and their fast food fever-dream.","confusingWith":[],"candidateIdentifiers":{"steamAppId":"1433340"},"sources":[{"label":"Steam Store","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1433340/","accessedAt":"2026-10-15T10:32:24.548Z","supports":["officialName","productType","identifiedVersionReleaseYear","developers","publishers","platforms","genres","shortDescription","steamMetadata.links","steamMetadata.storageRequirements","steamMetadata.controllerSupport","steamMetadata.playerModes"]}],"confidence":"high","status":"identified","verificationNotes":["The supplied name exactly matches the normalized official Steam name for the supplied App ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T10:32:24.548Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"1433340","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1433340/","officialWebsite":"https://www.happyshumble.com/","support":"https://discord.com/invite/happyshumble"},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":15,"unit":"GB","display":"15 GB","approximateBytes":15000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 15 GB"},"recommended":{"value":15,"unit":"GB","display":"15 GB","approximateBytes":15000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 15 GB"}},"macos":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"full","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":false,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player"]},"genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","Simulation"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":29,"description":"Steam Trading Cards"},{"id":41,"description":"Remote Play on Phone"},{"id":42,"description":"Remote Play on Tablet"},{"id":43,"description":"Remote Play on TV"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"1433340","steamName":"Happy's Humble Burger Farm","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1433340/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:03:45.530700+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Congrats, you're hired! Serve customers and maintain the Happy's Humble Burger Farm restaurant alone on the overnight. But be careful; things fall apart if you mess up! After work, head home and keep your eyes open for a way to escape the Barnyard Buds and their fast food fever-dream.","detailedDescription":"Join Our Discord!\n\nAbout the Game\n \n\nCongratulations! You’ve just been hired to work the night shift! You’ll be all by yourself, we trust you can handle it…\n\nYou’ll be grilling patties, operating deep fryers, and pouring drinks at our quiet restaurant on the edge of town. The customers sure do love the menu; they can’t get enough of the Happy’s Deluxe, Fantastic Fowl, and Poppin’ Pork sandwiches. The fries and salmon nugs are also a big hit. I hear rumors of Happy-Dogs and desserts in the near future, too!\n\nWhen each customer makes an order, it’s up to you to make a plan and execute it well. If you give customers the wrong order, or take too long, it’ll count as an infraction. If you get three of those  infractions, well... let’s just say Happy the Humble Heifer isn’t as joyful when the customers are upset. DO NOT UPSET HAPPY. TRUST US.\n\nBut hey, you’ll do fine! Just as long as you don’t upset Happy, you’ll do great! We believe in you!\n\n•  State of the art restaurant management simulation! Cook food, fill drinks, and serve customers!\n\n•  Upgrade your restaurant to make your job even easier!\n\n•  Chaotic Restaurant Event System - put out fires, take out the trash, get those rats!\n\n•  Engrossing narrative in STORY MODE. Uncover the secrets of the Happy’s Humble Burger Farm franchise, Obscura Biotech, and your very existence.\n\n•  Unlockable ENDLESS MODE that focuses on just the cooking\n\n•  Stalk the streets and storefronts of New Elysian City\n\n•  Earn extra cash doing side-jobs at the restaurant, or visit the Steal ‘n’ Sell and earn credits for things  you find on your travels!\n\n•  Uncover audio logs and research pages to piece together the mystery of New Elysian City\n\n•  Discover the history of Happy the Humble Heifer and her Barnyard Buds!\n\n•  Around 2 hours of Talk Radio and 60+ television programs to zone out to, featuring epic cameos !\n\n•  Interactive jukebox with 9 brand new albums recorded exclusively for the game, as well as 5 returning classics such as Landing Gear and Senile Showdown OST!","aboutGame":"Congratulations! You’ve just been hired to work the night shift! You’ll be all by yourself, we trust you can handle it…\n\nYou’ll be grilling patties, operating deep fryers, and pouring drinks at our quiet restaurant on the edge of town. The customers sure do love the menu; they can’t get enough of the Happy’s Deluxe, Fantastic Fowl, and Poppin’ Pork sandwiches. The fries and salmon nugs are also a big hit. I hear rumors of Happy-Dogs and desserts in the near future, too!\n\nWhen each customer makes an order, it’s up to you to make a plan and execute it well. If you give customers the wrong order, or take too long, it’ll count as an infraction. If you get three of those  infractions, well... let’s just say Happy the Humble Heifer isn’t as joyful when the customers are upset. DO NOT UPSET HAPPY. TRUST US.\n\nBut hey, you’ll do fine! Just as long as you don’t upset Happy, you’ll do great! We believe in you!\n\n•  State of the art restaurant management simulation! Cook food, fill drinks, and serve customers!\n\n•  Upgrade your restaurant to make your job even easier!\n\n•  Chaotic Restaurant Event System - put out fires, take out the trash, get those rats!\n\n•  Engrossing narrative in STORY MODE. Uncover the secrets of the Happy’s Humble Burger Farm franchise, Obscura Biotech, and your very existence.\n\n•  Unlockable ENDLESS MODE that focuses on just the cooking\n\n•  Stalk the streets and storefronts of New Elysian City\n\n•  Earn extra cash doing side-jobs at the restaurant, or visit the Steal ‘n’ Sell and earn credits for things  you find on your travels!\n\n•  Uncover audio logs and research pages to piece together the mystery of New Elysian City\n\n•  Discover the history of Happy the Humble Heifer and her Barnyard Buds!\n\n•  Around 2 hours of Talk Radio and 60+ television programs to zone out to, featuring epic cameos !\n\n•  Interactive jukebox with 9 brand new albums recorded exclusively for the game, as well as 5 returning classics such as Landing Gear and Senile Showdown OST!"},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433340/49b610cb62fc2e9b28d1d6b98fc30bc4f7e096ec/header.jpg?t=1785500419"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433340/75cd4069e00d807a5f738a9ab3809aab7396e48c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785500419"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433340/extras/922774466d6aee7758c93cf82d0e3a78.webp?t=1785500419","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433340/extras/9d51c36d01e9db00a24c36606198afbf.webp?t=1785500419","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433340/extras/93eb461cd80602eadece48073b0b7472.webp?t=1785500419","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433340/extras/1b5622e9a4932b502180f977ab4ca26e.webp?t=1785500419","alt":""}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433340/ss_5cbc589798ba547dc714f24859b33113d240278b.600x338.jpg?t=1785500419","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1433340/ss_5cbc589798ba547dc714f24859b33113